Journey: Alerts, frames and windows
Tags: @the-internet
Base URL: https://the-internet.herokuapp.com

Open /javascript_alerts
Accept the next alert
Click the "Click for JS Alert" button
  Expect an alert saying "I am a JS Alert"
  Expect the page contains "You successfully clicked an alert"
Dismiss the next confirm dialog
Click the "Click for JS Confirm" button
  Expect the page contains "You clicked: Cancel"
Answer the next prompt with "EZTest"
Click the "Click for JS Prompt" button
  Expect the page contains "You entered: EZTest"

Open /nested_frames
In frame "frame-top" > "frame-left"
  Expect the page contains "LEFT"
End
In frame "frame-top" > "frame-middle": expect the page contains "MIDDLE"
Switch to frame "frame-bottom"
Expect the page contains "BOTTOM"
Switch to the main frame

Open /iframe
In the "Rich Text Area" frame
  Expect the page contains "Your content goes here."
End

Open /windows
Click the "Click Here" link and switch to the new tab
  Expect the URL contains "/windows/new"
  Expect the "New Window" heading is visible
Expect there are 2 tabs open
Close the tab
Expect the page contains "Opening a new window"
Expect 1 window is open
